WEBVTT

00:00:03.245 --> 00:00:07.043
The site's time zone is used to show dates and times to everyone

00:00:07.043 --> 00:00:08.942
who has not picked their own.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.515
Open Settings, General.

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:15.115
Default Time Zone now offers only your friendly names.

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:18.914
Choose one, here Mexico City Time, and click Save.

